{"id": 10001361, "reference": "A12/00843/20", "publication_date": "2020-06-02T15:14:42.327Z", "modification_date": "2020-06-02T15:41:45.628Z", "country": "Finland", "product_category": "MACHINERY", "product_name": "Vehicle lift", "product_name_specific": null, "risk_description": "The latch of the product might fail, causing the carrying device to fall, leading to injuries. \nThe lifting arm, nips of the lifting chains and ropes lack the appropriate protective element. Consequently, the feet or hands of the user could become trapped leading to injuries.\n\nThere is no protection of the hoses and against hydraulic fluid spray. If the hydraulic fluid hose is damaged, the high pressure fluid may cause injuries to the operator. \n\nThe product's pressure gauge and pressure relief valve did not properly work. This could lead to excessive pressure of the hydraulic system of the lift, causing hydraulic fluid to leak under high pressure, causing injuries to a person close the lift. \n\nThe carrying device is not stable enough. Consequently, while lowering a vehicle, it inadvertently move, leading to injuries to persons close to the vehicle. \n\nMoreover, there is no limiting of the lowering speed, which could result in a fast descend of the lift, causing injuries to a person close to or underneath the lift. ", "legal_provision": " The product does not comply with the requirements of the Machinery Directive and the relevant European standard EN 1493. ", "country_of_origin": "People's Republic of China", "sold_online": "YES", "notification_type": "ARTICLE_12", "brands": ["Trainsway"], "model_types": ["SF-B4000"], "risk_types": ["INJURIES"], "measures": ["PRODUCT_RECALL_FROM_CONSUMERS"], "embedding_model": "siglip2-b16-256", "embedding_dim": 768, "photos": [{"photo_id": 10011154, "main": true, "embedding": ""}]}